on mortality and vascular complications: systematic review and meta-analyses. Diabetologia. 
2021;64(2):275–287. doi:10.1007/s00125-020-05319-w
[2] Barrett-Connor E, Wingard D, Wong N, Goldberg R. Chapter 18: Heart disease and diabetes 
(PDF, 1.07 MB) . In: Cowie CC, Casagrande SS, Menke A, et al, eds. Diabetes in America, 3rd ed. 
NIH Pub No. 17-1468. National Institutes of Health; 2018:18.1–18.30
[3] Pikula A, Howard BV, Seshadri S. Chapter 19: Stroke and diabetes (PDF, 493.93 KB) . In: Cowie 
CC, Casagrande SS, Menke A, et al, eds. Diabetes in America, 3rd ed. NIH Pub No. 17-1468. 
National Institutes of Health; 2018:19.1–19.23
